  "summary": "Malicious code in gaarf-node-bq (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (node postinstall.js) collects host metadata — hostname, platform, architecture, Node version, package name, and timestamp — and POSTs it to the remote endpoint yu7pug2j[.]instances[.]poc[.]jchunt[.]top at path /gaarf-node-bq. The package name impersonates the Google Ads API Report Fetcher (gaarf) project. The beacon runs automatically on install without user consent.",
